				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.108
			</span></i> (the signf. <i>white</i> is very late); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσπρον, τό,</span>
			<i>white of an egg,</i> [<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i>] <i><span class="en">
				14.560
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> name of an
				<i>ingredient of incense,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.146
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				148
			</span></i>.</div>
